        <item>
            <title>3.11.0</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 01:14:26 +0900</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/Saqoosha/Canopy</link>
            <sparkle:version>176</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.11.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Changes
- The control API's status verbs report `permission` while a tool permission prompt is waiting, instead of `working`.
- `pending_requests` also returns `inputRaw`, the tool input as structured JSON (omitted when it exceeds 16 KB).
]]></description>
